    "name": "Circuit Issues KiCad OutputJob Plugin",
    "description": "Generate common post-design outputs (Gerbers, BOM, STEP, renders, iBOM, JLCPCB) from one dialog",
    "description_full": "An Action Plugin for KiCad 9/10 that consolidates common post-design export tasks into a single dialog. Supports schematic PDF, STEP 3D model, Gerbers, drill files, pick-and-place CSV, BOM CSV, 3D render PNGs, SVGs for visual diffs, ERC/DRC checks, a schematic-vs-PCB DNP check, summary reports, and optional integration with the JLC Plugin for KiCad and InteractiveHtmlBom. Settings are stored per-project in a local .kicad_plugin_config.json file. Includes a headless CLI (cli.py) for CI servers.",
